  "description_html": "https://aekraft.gumroad.com/l/bfhpzl\",\"price\":79.0}}</script>\n<style inertia=\"custom_styles\">:root{--accent: 255 144 232;--accent-with-text: 255 144 232;--contrast-accent: 0 0 0;--font-family: \"ABC Favorit\", \"ABC Favorit\", sans-serif;--color: 0 0 0;--primary: var(--color);--contrast-primary: 255 255 255;--filled: 255 255 255;--contrast-filled: var(--color);--danger: 220 52 30;--contrast-danger: 255 255 255;--body-bg: #ffffff;--active-bg: rgb(var(--color) / var(--gray-1));--border-alpha: 1;--radius: 0.25rem;--button-hover-offset: 0.25rem}body{background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:\"ABC Favorit\", \"ABC Favorit\", sans-serif}\n</style>\n</head>\n\n  <body id=\"product_page\" class=\"group/body\" style=\"\">\n    <div id=\"design-settings\" data-settings=\"{\"font\":{\"name\":\"ABC Favorit\",\"url\":\"https://assets.gumroad.com/fonts/ABCFavorit-Regular.woff2\"}}\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n    <div id=\"user-agent-info\" data-settings=\"{\"is_mobile\":false}\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n    \n    \n    <div id=\"app\" data-page=\"{\"component\":\"Products/Show\",\"props\":{\"errors\":{},\"design_settings\":{\"font\":{\"name\":\"ABC Favorit\",\"url\":\"https://assets.gumroad.com/fonts/ABCFavorit-Regular.woff2\"}},\"domain_settings\":{\"scheme\":\"https\",\"app_domain\":\"gumroad.com\",\"root_domain\":\"gumroad.com\",\"short_domain\":\"gum.co\",\"discover_domain\":\"gumroad.com\",\"third_party_analytics_domain\":\"gumroad-analytics.com\",\"api_domain\":\"api.gumroad.com\"},\"user_agent_info\":{\"is_mobile\":false},\"logged_in_user\":null,\"current_seller\":null,\"csp_nonce\":\"OaQ0kyvBkfNB80BTOmoPfqJwCdaHFda3t5WOGj3+yqg=\",\"locale\":\"en-US\",\"feature_flags\":{\"disable_stripe_signup\":true},\"authenticity_token\":\"04X78iKAB29EF-aRhNNvJi2HflGp_sbnH15Z_tymI7fe4MeqwzM4w7qZmHNwTEAp6_3fUUT2UEyYwcmg3NmWTw\",\"flash\":null,\"title\":\"Etsy Suspension: Triage + Appeal Bundle (Both Steps, 25+ Pages)\",\"detected_buyer_currency\":null,\"is_mobile_app_web_view\":false,\"product\":{\"id\":\"LzOV85deBGdLgNZmvpvYGw==\",\"permalink\":\"bfhpzl\",\"name\":\"Etsy Suspension: Triage + Appeal Bundle (Both Steps, 25+ Pages)\",\"seller\":{\"id\":\"1856300876639\",\"name\":\"aek grafat\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://assets.gumroad.com/images/gumroad-default-avatar-5.png\",\"profile_url\":\"https://aekraft.gumroad.com/\",\"is_verified\":false},\"collaborating_user\":null,\"covers\":[],\"main_cover_id\":null,\"thumbnail_url\":null,\"quantity_remaining\":null,\"long_url\":\"https://aekraft.gumroad.com/l/bfhpzl\",\"is_sales_limited\":false,\"ratings\":{\"count\":0,\"average\":0.0,\"percentages\":[0,0,0,0,0]},\"seller_reputation\":null,\"custom_button_text_option\":null,\"is_compliance_blocked\":false,\"is_published\":true,\"is_stream_only\":false,\"streamable\":false,\"sales_count\":null,\"summary\":null,\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"Size\",\"value\":\"173 KB\"}],\"description_html\":\"Suspended? Two steps, and most sellers do them in the wrong order.\n\nSTEP 1 - Find the exact policy you were cited for ($49 on its own, included here)\nA 10-question decision tree that ends at one specific policy, what to fix BEFORE you appeal, and what to do if you got no reason email at all. Includes the suspension reasons Etsy actually sends and the silent-suspension path most guides never mention.\n\nSTEP 2 - Prepare and write the appeal\n19 pages: temporary vs permanent triage, the Appeals Center walkthrough in Etsy's own question order, the 6-month window worked backwards from your suspension date, what to fix per violation type, and 11 checklists to run under time pressure.\n\nPLUS - two fill-in appeal letter templates (IP/trademark and policy-violation), an evidence tracker spreadsheet, and a README tying it together.\n\nSix files, 25+ pages, one download.\n\nWHY THE ORDER MATTERS\nEtsy's own guidance is to resolve the cited issue before you appeal. Reviewers want evidence the problem is already fixed, not a promise. An appeal aimed at the wrong policy is the most common reason appeals are rejected.\n\nTHE CLOCK\nEtsy allows 6 months to appeal a permanent suspension. The guide works that window backwards from your suspension date so you can see what is still available to you.\n\nWHAT THIS IS NOT\n- No outcome or savings amount is guaranteed. Etsy makes the final decision.\n- Not professional, financial, or legal advice. A preparation and process guide.\n- Not a substitute for Etsy's current Seller Policy or House Rules, which change.\n- No AI appeal generator. No subscription. Files you own, used once.\n- Templates contain placeholders. Never submit false statements.\n\nSTRAIGHT WITH YOU\nSmall independent seller. We have sold 0 of these and have no reviews, so there is no track record - you are buying on the contents, and you can open every page before you decide. 30-day money back guarantee. If it is not useful, tell us why; that is worth more to us than a sale. Would rather not spend $79 on an unknown seller? Email \\u003ca href=\\\"mailto:galaxyaek7@gmail.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"\\u003egalaxyaek7@gmail.com\\u003c/a\\u003e and ask for a free copy.\n\nNot sure you need both steps?\nThe Policy Triage on its own is $49 and covers step 1 only:\n\\u003ca href=\\\"https://aekraft.gumroad.com/l/sjrjxq\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\"\\u003ehttps://aekraft.gumroad.com/l/sjrjxq\\u003c/a\\u003e\n\nIf you are not sure whether your suspension is temporary or permanent, or you\nonly want to know which policy you were cited for before spending on anything\nelse, start there. Buy the bundle instead if you want the appeal writing\nincluded as well.\n\nEXACTLY WHAT YOU DOWNLOAD (one .zip, six files, 173 KB)\n  etsy_policy_triage.pdf                    10 KB   step 1, 6 pages\n  etsy_suspension_appeal_kit.pdf           122 KB   step 2, 19 pages\n  etsy_appeal_letter_template_A_IP.docx     36 KB   letter for IP/trademark cases\n  etsy_appeal_letter_template_B_policy.docx 36 KB   letter for policy violations\n  etsy_appeal_evidence_tracker.xlsx          6 KB   deadline log, open cases, checklist\n  README.txt                                 1 KB   which file to open first\n\nThose are the exact filenames and sizes inside the archive - not a summary of\nthem. Unzip it and you can check every line above against what is on your disk\nbefore you decide whether the guide is any use to you. Both .docx templates\nopen in Word, Google Docs or Pages; the tracker opens in Excel, Numbers or\nSheets. No software to install, no account to create, nothing that phones home\nor expires.\",\"currency_code\":\"usd\",\"price_cents\":7900,\"buyer_currency_display\":{\"product_id\":\"LzOV85deBGdLgNZmvpvYGw==\",\"buyer_currency_shown\":\"usd\",\"product_currency\":\"usd\",\"buyer_local_price_cents\":null,\"rate\":null,\"display_mode\":\"default\"},\"rental_price_cents\":null,\"pwyw\":null,\"eligible_for_installment_plans\":true,\"allow_installment_plan\":false,\"installment_plan\":null,\"is_legacy_subscription\":false,\"is_tiered_membership\":false,\"is_recurring_billing\":false,\"is_physical\":false,\"custom_view_content_button_text\":null,\"is_multiseat_license\":false,\"is_licensed\":false,\"hide_sold_out_variants\":false,\"native_type\":\"digital\",\"preorder\":null,\"duration_in_months\":null,\"rental\":null,\"is_quantity_enabled\":false,\"free_trial\":null,\"recurrences\":null,\"options\":[],\"analytics\":{\"google_analytics_id\":null,\"facebook_pixel_id\":null,\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"free_sales\":true},\"has_third_party_analytics\":false,\"ppp_details\":null,\"can_edit\":false,\"refund_policy\":{\"title\":\"30-day money back guarantee\",\"fine_print\":null,\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-13\"},\"bundle_products\":[],\"public_files\":[]},\"discount_code\":null,\"purchase\":null,\"wishlists\":[],\"currency_code\":\"usd\",\"show_ratings_filter\":true,\"creator_profile\":{\"external_id\":\"1856